  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 10 per block (大正 12 – 昭和 7), 4 blocks (總數, サイパン, パラオ, ボナペ) = 40 rows of 44 columns. 同 expanded to the era name. The table runs across the whole spread (pp. 236-237 of frame p0152); the 年次 column is printed at the left of p. 236 and again at the right edge of p. 237 (not repeated here).",
   "The title is split across the gutter ('112 地方法院檢事局刑事' + '事件起訴件數罪名別'), and so are the block headings: 總 | 數, サイパン (p. 236) + 地方法院檢事局 (p. 237), パラオ地方 + 法院檢事局, ボナペ地方 + 法院檢事局; the block label joins them. The heading printed over the left page is 刑 (p. 236) … 法 … 犯 (p. 237) for the 刑法犯 group and 特別法犯 for the second group (headed 特 | 別 法 犯); the last column is 警察犯.",
   "Column names follow the sibling table 103: 竊盜 and 橫領 are printed 窃盜 and 横領; 交通港 is printed on two lines (交通 / 港); 阿片モルヒネ is printed stacked; 藝妓酌婦 is printed stacked; 放失火 as 放失/火.",
   "Checks (python3): for every row, 總數 = 刑法犯 總數 + 特別法犯 總數 + 警察犯; 刑法犯 總數 = sum of the 27 listed offences (公務 … 毀棄); 特別法犯 總數 = sum of the 12 listed items (銃砲 … 藝妓酌婦); and for every column the 總數 block = サイパン + パラオ + ボナペ. All reconcile except those listed next.",
   "Block 總數, 大正 12, 總數: the last digit of '53' is a faded 3 or 8; only 58 reconciles (刑法犯 50 + 特別法犯 8 + 警察犯 —, and also サイパン 25 + パラオ 12 + ボナペ 21); entered as 58 (3-vs-8 rule; the 刑法犯 50 and 特別法犯 8 read with confidence).",
   "Block 總數, 昭和 1: 特別法犯 總數 76 but the listed items sum to 71 (銃砲 3 + 酒類 63 + 漁業 2 + 兵役法 3); the 酒類 figure '63' is clearly a 3 on enlargement and differs from the sum of the three branch blocks (31 + 31 + 6 = 68), so the source is inconsistent (the printed 76 and the branch blocks both imply 68). Kept as printed; does NOT reconcile (diff 5 in the row, diff 5 in the 酒類 column).",
   "Block 總數, 昭和 4: 刑法犯 總數 printed 85 (clear) but the listed offences sum to 86 and the branch blocks give 34 + 31 + 21 = 86; also 總數 218 ≠ 85 + 132 (= 217). Kept as printed; does NOT reconcile (diff 1).",
   "Small cell notes: サイパン 昭和 4 酒類 read as 26 (the last digit has a broken top, same shape as the 26 above it; 26 is what makes the row and column checks reconcile — read from the glyph, not settled by the total). The 警察犯 column of the 總數 block has a faint ghost duplicate of the figure beside the right-hand double rule (e.g. 8 / 8 in 大正 13); only the figure inside the column is recorded.",
   "All other empty-looking cells are printed dashes (—); nothing is blank in the original.",
   "Editor: the place name written ボナペ by the reader is given as ポナペ, the form used throughout the volume (the handakuten is hard to see in the small type)."
  ],
